<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank says plans office in Bogota.</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank says plans office in Bogota.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said on Wednesday that it planned to open a representative office in Bogota, in conjunction with its affiliated unit Vereins-und Westbank.</p>
<p>The Bavarian-based Vereinsbank said it wanted to use the new office to increase its presence on the American continent and said that Colombia was an economic area with potential.</p>
<p>Vereinsbank said it already identified a notable amount of potential business in Bogota.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
